&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InterSystems is the place for someone looking for a challenging IT career and access to the kind of training, expertise and development tools that only a large company can offer. Our international reach also means you have the opportunity to be part of a truly global organization of smart, technically-minded people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InterSystems employs clinicians and PAS staff as quality specialists to enhance the quality, safety and usability of innovative products that transform healthcare organisations. Apply your clinical and/or hospital knowledge with cutting-edge tools and technologies to improve patient outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work as a quality specialist embedded in a cross-functional agile development team focusing on product quality. Agile teams consist of developers and product specialists collectively responsible for all stages of product development from design to validation.&lt;/p&gt;
