&lt;li&gt;Design and execute detailed testing scenarios to validate application functionality and clinical safety.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Record test scenarios into automated regression scripts using InterSystems test automation toolkit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate and plan regression script coverage for release validation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creation and maintenance of documentation relating to functional specifications, workflows, agile processes, and update reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other duties may be directed by the company from time to time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience and Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
