&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated interest in IT and the application of technology to add value and/or solve problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to leverage AI-enabled tools to improve productivity, documentation, analysis and implementation activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
