&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The duties assigned include, but are not limited to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
