&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InterSystems is seeking an experienced and highly organised Facilities &amp;amp; Office Manager to lead facilities, workplace and office operations across the Middle East region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Based in Dubai, the role will have primary responsibility for ensuring the Dubai office provides a safe, professional, efficient and high-quality working environment, while providing facilities and operational support to other regional offices as required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on and diverse role requiring strong experience in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Facilities Management, Workplace Operations and Office Management&lt;/strong&gt;. The successful candidate will manage facilities, suppliers, contracts, office projects, compliance and general office administration, including company licences, insurance and other operational renewals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Facilities &amp;amp; Workplace Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the day-to-day facilities and workplace operations for InterSystems offices across the Middle East, with primary responsibility for the Dubai office and regional support as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all offices provide a safe, functional, professional and high-quality working environment for employees and visitors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee planned and reactive maintenance, ensuring issues are resolved efficiently and with minimal disruption to business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the primary liaison with landlords, building management, contractors and facilities service providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage facilities services including maintenance, cleaning, security, utilities, office equipment and workplace services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate records relating to maintenance, service contracts, facilities assets, certificates and compliance documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor facilities performance and identify opportunities to improve service quality, efficiency and cost management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Office &amp;amp; Corporate Administration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage general office administration and operational requirements for the UAE office and provide support to other regional offices as required.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a tracker for key company, office and operational renewals, ensuring licences, registrations, insurance policies and other required documentation remain current.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate the renewal of company licences, office-related permits, registrations, insurance policies and other corporate documentation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaise with relevant authorities, free zones, landlords, insurers and external service providers on office and operational requirements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage office supplies, equipment and workplace services, ensuring appropriate quality and cost effectiveness.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate meetings, client visits, training sessions, events and senior management visits, including venue and catering arrangements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate employee travel arrangements, including flights, accommodation, visas and car hire, in partnership with the relevant internal teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support HR with employee services, company events and other office administration requirements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support regional projects and operational initiatives as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Office Expansions, Moves &amp;amp; Fit-Outs&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and coordinate office expansions, relocations, fit-outs, refurbishments and workplace upgrades across the region.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with internal stakeholders to understand workplace and business requirements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaise with property agents, landlords and other stakeholders when identifying and evaluating potential office premises.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate site visits and support the evaluation of office options, costs and commercial proposals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Work with architects, designers, contractors and service providers throughout office projects.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Monitor project timelines, budgets and quality to ensure successful delivery.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Coordinate employee moves and ensure minimal disruption to business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health, Safety, Security &amp;amp; Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure offices meet relevant Health &amp;amp; Safety, security and workplace compliance requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain Health &amp;amp; Safety documentation, risk assessments and relevant facilities certifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with building management and external specialists to ensure required inspections and maintenance are completed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure appropriate emergency procedures and workplace notices are in place.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate and maintain relevant emergency response arrangements, including fire wardens and first aid requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support ongoing facilities compliance and relevant ISO and environmental requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with relevant internal stakeholders to ensure facilities-related policies and procedures remain current.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support business continuity and emergency preparedness activities for the region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 5–7 years&#39; experience in Facilities Management or Workplace Operations within a corporate environment with equivalent relevant qualification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience managing corporate office facilities, building operations, maintenance and service providers is essential.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing office operations and general corporate administration.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing suppliers, contractors, facilities-related contracts, budgets and service levels.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience coordinating office moves, expansions, fit-outs, refurbishments and workplace projects.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing company licences, insurance, renewals and operational compliance is preferred.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting multiple offices or regional operations, preferably within the UAE/Middle East.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good knowledge of Health &amp;amp; Safety, facilities compliance and building management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;IOSH, NEBOSH, IWFM or equivalent qualification is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organisational, project management, stakeholder management and communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive, commercially minded and solutions-oriented, with strong attention to detail and the ability to manage multiple priorities independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
