&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Global Marketing Programs Specialist&lt;/strong&gt; supports the development and execution of global marketing programs, with a particular focus on building and activating co-marketing programs with strategic cloud partners. Working across Product Marketing, Global Marketing, Regional Marketing, Sales, and Partner teams, this role coordinates joint campaigns, content, events, and other go-to-market initiatives that increase awareness, engagement, and pipeline.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a member of the Product Marketing team, you will be based in Boston, MA, and you’ll work closely with teams around the world as well as with our cloud partnership team and various external vendors. You should be a self-starter, eager to grow your understanding of data management, healthcare, supply chain, financial services, and cloud service provider channels while applying your project management skills and marketing campaign experience to streamline processes, improve efficiencies, and tell the InterSystems story.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
