&lt;li&gt;Work with the engineering/architecture teams to design solutions so as to maximize performance, efficiency and operability of hosted solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and/or participate in the provisioning and deployment of server, network and other hosting-related equipment, including hands-on build and configuration as/when required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in the deployment of new applications and/or changes, ensuring that all service components are documented and monitored and integrated into the company’s operational processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform hardware qualification testing on new hardware platforms and certify them for production deployments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with stakeholders across the solutions lifecycle to ensure that pre-operational sign-offs are obtained, so as to ensure that solutions can be operated in a way that meets or exceeds performance targets e.g. security, availability and response times.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with the troubleshooting of integration issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consulting with technical stakeholders (including customers) on the delivery of hosted solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities – Operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on administration and maintenance of hosted solutions and related infrastructure (firewalls, switches, servers, storage, etc.) including pro-active identification and fixing of potential incidents, backup management, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in the definition, documentation, operation and continuous improvement of operational processes e.g. ITIL-based processes such as incident, change, problem and configuration management, and the smooth integration of these with wider company processes and systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define, implement, monitor and report on metrics that are required for the delivery of highly-available hosted services, as well as to meet the needs of the wider organization e.g. management, engineering, customer services and our customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical support for all areas of hosted services, including participation on a 24x7 on-call rota; ensure the timely resolution of incidents and/or problems affecting hosted solutions and deploy approved changes and/or updates as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Further enhance the automation of hosting-related processes e.g. deployment of changes, deployment of new services, inventory management, security scanning, service level reporting, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience &amp;amp; Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on experience with server hosting (e.g. data center) infrastructure and (ideally) management with Cisco UCS blades&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on storage/SAN deployment and (ideally) management experience with EMC Unity, Data Domain, Avamar. Dell D?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on Cisco and F5 networking deployment and management experience with Cisco Nexus 7000/9000, ASA Firewalls, F5 LTM and DNS load balancers, route domains and contexts. Active Directory/Windows – More Linux &amp;gt; Windows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on VMware deployment and management experience with VMware 6.x/7.x 8&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on Linux deployment and management experience with RHEL 7.x&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on Windows domain and AD management experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong troubleshooting skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong scripting skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enthusiasm and talent for acquiring complex technical skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good customer service attitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of service monitoring and alerting (Nagios, Cacti preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of configuration management (Puppet and/or Red Hat Satellite preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scripting for automation using technologies (e.g. Powershell, Puppet, Ansible, Python)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ITIL knowledge – principles and application&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to support and develop junior colleague&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About InterSystems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;InterSystems, a creative data technology provider, delivers a unified foundation for next-generation applications for healthcare, finance, manufacturing, and supply chain customers in more than 80 countries. Our data platforms solve interoperability, speed, and scalability problems for large organizations around the globe to unlock the power of data and allow people to perceive data in imaginative ways. Established in 1978, InterSystems is committed to excellence through its 24×7 support for customers and partners around the world. Privately held and headquartered in Boston, Massachusetts, InterSystems has 38 offices in 28 countries worldwide. For more information, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https://www.intersystems.com/&amp;amp;esheet=53379223&amp;amp;newsitemid=20230410005415&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=InterSystems.com&amp;amp;index=4&amp;amp;md5=3edf749fa33f5a2ac0c355c410576e90&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;1e721f69-f681-4067-9281-970e94b3ef11&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InterSystems.com&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Disclaimer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InterSystems may use AI tools for its internal operations including administrative tasks during recruitment (e.g., organizing candidate information). &amp;nbsp;InterSystems’ approach to AI is guided by the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.intersystems.com/ai-use-guidelines/&quot;&gt;InterSystems Responsible AI Guidelines&lt;/a&gt;. AI is not used to make or influence hiring decisions. All decisions are made by InterSystems employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates may use AI for CV or interview preparation, provided materials are truthful and reflect their own experience. &amp;nbsp;AI tools and third-party transcription services must not be used during interviews or assessments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that the use of wearable technology, including any AI-related tools or other technology-connected devices (such as META or Google smart glasses and/or wearables, and/or any similar devices), is&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;strictly prohibited&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;during the interview and screening process with InterSystems.&amp;nbsp; Any applicant who requires a wearable device or any type of technology support during the interview process as a reasonable accommodation under the ADA or applicable state or country laws and regulations must contact the InterSystems Human Resources Department&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;prior&lt;/em&gt; to attending or participating in any interview or screening process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;Senior Infrastructure Engineer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Nuestro equipo de Hosting entrega las soluciones de InterSystems como servicios alojados (hosted) o administrados (managed services) en cualquier parte del mundo. A medida que cada vez más clientes migran hacia soluciones alojadas, estamos buscando un/a Senior Infrastructure Engineer para unirse al equipo de Chile, dar soporte a nuestros clientes de Latinoamérica y ayudarnos a mantener los altos niveles de disponibilidad, rendimiento y seguridad que nuestros clientes esperan de nosotros.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Esta posición ofrece una excelente oportunidad para trabajar con tecnologías de vanguardia, resolver desafíos complejos, proponer mejoras continuas y generar un impacto visible dentro de la organización.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Responsabilidades – Implementación&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trabajar con nuestros socios de colocation para diseñar distribuciones adecuadas de cages, racks y servidores, asegurando la disponibilidad continua de espacio, energía y refrigeración para soportar soluciones actuales y futuras.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Colaborar con los equipos de ingeniería y arquitectura en el diseño de soluciones que maximicen el rendimiento, la eficiencia y la operatividad de los servicios alojados.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liderar y/o participar en el aprovisionamiento y despliegue de servidores, redes y otros equipos relacionados con hosting, incluyendo tareas prácticas de instalación y configuración cuando sea necesario.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participar en la implementación de nuevas aplicaciones y cambios, asegurando que todos los componentes del servicio estén documentados, monitoreados e integrados a los procesos operacionales de la compañía.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Realizar pruebas de certificación y validación de nuevas plataformas de hardware para su uso en entornos productivos.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trabajar con distintos stakeholders durante todo el ciclo de vida de las soluciones para asegurar las aprobaciones previas a la operación y garantizar que estas cumplan o superen los objetivos de rendimiento, seguridad, disponibilidad y tiempos de respuesta.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apoyar la resolución de problemas relacionados con integraciones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Asesorar a stakeholders técnicos, incluyendo clientes, en la entrega de soluciones alojadas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Responsabilidades – Operaciones&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Administrar y mantener soluciones alojadas e infraestructura asociada (firewalls, switches, servidores IBM Power Series, Dell PowerFlex, Dell PowerEdge, entre otros), incluyendo identificación y resolución proactiva de incidentes potenciales, gestión de respaldos y mantenimiento general.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participar en la definición, documentación, operación y mejora continua de procesos operacionales basados en ITIL, incluyendo gestión de incidentes, cambios, problemas y configuración.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Definir, implementar, monitorear y reportar métricas necesarias para la entrega de servicios altamente disponibles, así como para satisfacer requerimientos de áreas como gestión, ingeniería, soporte al cliente y clientes finales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Brindar soporte técnico a todas las áreas relacionadas con servicios alojados, incluyendo participación en turnos de disponibilidad 24x7, asegurando la resolución oportuna de incidentes y la implementación de cambios aprobados.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Impulsar la automatización de procesos relacionados con hosting, incluyendo despliegue de cambios, implementación de nuevos servicios, gestión de inventario, escaneo de seguridad y reportes de niveles de servicio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Requisitos y Calificaciones&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inglés avanzado (mínimo nivel B2, idealmente C1), con capacidad para mantener conversaciones técnicas y profesionales con equipos de Norteamérica y Europa.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experiencia práctica sólida en infraestructura de hosting y centros de datos.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experiencia en implementación y administración de almacenamiento SAN, idealmente con IBM FlashSystem y Dell PowerStore.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experiencia práctica en AWS y/o Google Cloud Platform (GCP). Certificaciones en estas plataformas serán consideradas una ventaja.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experiencia en redes y firewalls, idealmente Cisco (Routing, ASA, FTD), además de conocimientos en balanceadores de carga y soluciones DNS Global Load Balancing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experiencia en implementación y administración de VMware 8.x. Experiencia con Nutanix será considerada un plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experiencia en implementación y administración de Linux, especialmente RHEL 8.x o superior.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experiencia con Veritas (NetBackup, Backup Exec) y Veeam, incluyendo configuración y operación.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experiencia en administración de dominios Windows y Active Directory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conocimientos en herramientas de monitoreo y alertamiento (idealmente Nagios o CheckMK).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conocimientos en herramientas de gestión de configuración (idealmente Puppet y/o Red Hat Satellite).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experiencia en automatización mediante tecnologías como Ansible, Bash, Python, PowerShell o Puppet.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conocimiento de principios y aplicación de ITIL.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capacidad para apoyar y desarrollar a colegas más junior.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sólidas habilidades de análisis y resolución de problemas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excelente orientación al cliente.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interés y capacidad para adquirir habilidades técnicas complejas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Más de 8 años de experiencia como Infrastructure Engineer, Senior Infrastructure Engineer o roles equivalentes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;46&quot; data-end=&quot;86&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;46&quot; data-end=&quot;86&quot;&gt;Certificaciones altamente deseables:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;87&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;87&quot; data-end=&quot;155&quot;&gt;Dell PowerFlex Professional Certification (PowerFlex Professional)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;156&quot; data-end=&quot;191&quot;&gt;Nutanix Certified Associate (NCA)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;192&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Nutanix Certified Professional – Multicloud Infrastructure (NCP-MCI)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ubicación:&lt;/strong&gt; Ciudad Empresarial, Huechuraba, Región Metropolitana.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Esta oferta se enmarca en la Ley N° 21.015 de Inclusión Laboral de Personas con Discapacidad. InterSystems promueve la igualdad de oportunidades y la no discriminación en todos sus procesos de reclutamiento y selección, asegurando procesos inclusivos y accesibles, en conformidad con la normativa laboral vigente en Chile.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About InterSystems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;InterSystems, a creative data technology provider, delivers a unified foundation for next-generation applications for healthcare, finance, manufacturing, and supply chain customers in more than 80 countries. Our data platforms solve interoperability, speed, and scalability problems for large organizations around the globe to unlock the power of data and allow people to perceive data in imaginative ways. Established in 1978, InterSystems is committed to excellence through its 24×7 support for customers and partners around the world. Privately held and headquartered in Boston, Massachusetts, InterSystems has 38 offices in 28 countries worldwide. For more information, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https://www.intersystems.com/&amp;amp;esheet=53379223&amp;amp;newsitemid=20230410005415&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=InterSystems.com&amp;amp;index=4&amp;amp;md5=3edf749fa33f5a2ac0c355c410576e90&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;1e721f69-f681-4067-9281-970e94b3ef11&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InterSystems.com&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Disclaimer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InterSystems may use AI tools for its internal operations including administrative tasks during recruitment (e.g., organizing candidate information). &amp;nbsp;InterSystems’ approach to AI is guided by the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.intersystems.com/ai-use-guidelines/&quot;&gt;InterSystems Responsible AI Guidelines&lt;/a&gt;. AI is not used to make or influence hiring decisions. All decisions are made by InterSystems employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates may use AI for CV or interview preparation, provided materials are truthful and reflect their own experience. &amp;nbsp;AI tools and third-party transcription services must not be used during interviews or assessments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that the use of wearable technology, including any AI-related tools or other technology-connected devices (such as META or Google smart glasses and/or wearables, and/or any similar devices), is&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;strictly prohibited&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;during the interview and screening process with InterSystems.&amp;nbsp; Any applicant who requires a wearable device or any type of technology support during the interview process as a reasonable accommodation under the ADA or applicable state or country laws and regulations must contact the InterSystems Human Resources Department&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;prior&lt;/em&gt; to attending or participating in any interview or screening process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Starte Deine Karriere an der Schnittstelle von Software, Daten, AI und Gesundheitswesen&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Du hast Informatik, Medizininformatik, Wirtschaftsinformatik, Data Science oder ein vergleichbares technisches Fach studiert? Oder Du kommst aus der Software-Entwicklung, Software-Architektur, technischen Beratung, Data Engineering oder einer anderen technologiegetriebenen Rolle und möchtest Deine Erfahrung in einem sinnstiftenden Umfeld einsetzen?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Dann ist diese Rolle spannend für Dich.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Im Gesundheitswesen entstehen einige der komplexesten und wichtigsten Datenprobleme unserer Zeit: Patientendaten liegen in vielen unterschiedlichen Systemen, medizinische Prozesse müssen sicher digitalisiert werden, Informationen müssen zur richtigen Zeit am richtigen Ort verfügbar sein — und moderne AI-Lösungen funktionieren nur dann sinnvoll, wenn die zugrunde liegenden Daten vollständig, verlässlich, sicher und interoperabel sind.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Genau hier arbeitet&amp;nbsp;InterSystems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Unsere Technologien helfen&amp;nbsp;Healthcare-Organisationen weltweit dabei, Gesundheitsdaten zu verbinden, nutzbar zu machen und daraus moderne digitale Lösungen zu entwickeln.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Als Sales Engineer lernst Du, wie solche Plattformen funktionieren — technisch, fachlich und im Zusammenspiel mit Kunden.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Deine Rolle&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Dies ist keine klassische Vertriebsrolle. Es ist eine technische Rolle mit Kundenbezug — für Menschen, die Technologie verstehen, erklären und gemeinsam mit Kunden in sinnvolle Lösungen übersetzen wollen.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Du startest nicht als fertiger&amp;nbsp;Healthcare-Interoperabilitäts-Experte. Das erwarten wir auch nicht.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Wichtig ist, dass Du technische Grundlagen, Neugier, Kommunikationsstärke und echte Lernbereitschaft mitbringst. Je nach Erfahrung steigst Du mit unterschiedlicher Verantwortung ein — entscheidend ist nicht, ob Du bereits&amp;nbsp;Healthcare-Standards kennst, sondern ob Du die technischen Grundlagen und die Motivation mitbringst, Dich in dieses Umfeld einzuarbeiten.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;In dieser Rolle arbeitest Du an Themen wie:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Healthcare-Datenplattformen und Interoperabilität&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;APIs, Datenbanken, Datenmodelle und Integrationsarchitekturen&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;HL7, FHIR, IHE und andere Standards im Gesundheitswesen&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
