&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About InterSystems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;InterSystems, a creative data technology provider, delivers a unified foundation for next-generation applications for healthcare, finance, manufacturing, and supply chain customers in more than 80 countries. Our data platforms solve interoperability, speed, and scalability problems for large organizations around the globe to unlock the power of data and allow people to perceive data in imaginative ways. Established in 1978, InterSystems is committed to excellence through its 24×7 support for customers and partners around the world. Privately held and headquartered in Boston, Massachusetts, InterSystems has 38 offices in 28 countries worldwide. For more information, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https://www.intersystems.com/&amp;amp;esheet=53379223&amp;amp;newsitemid=20230410005415&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=InterSystems.com&amp;amp;index=4&amp;amp;md5=3edf749fa33f5a2ac0c355c410576e90&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;1e721f69-f681-4067-9281-970e94b3ef11&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InterSystems.com&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Disclaimer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InterSystems may use AI tools for its internal operations including administrative tasks during recruitment (e.g., organizing candidate information). &amp;nbsp;InterSystems’ approach to AI is guided by the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.intersystems.com/ai-use-guidelines/&quot;&gt;InterSystems Responsible AI Guidelines&lt;/a&gt;. AI is not used to make or influence hiring decisions. All decisions are made by InterSystems employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates may use AI for CV or interview preparation, provided materials are truthful and reflect their own experience. &amp;nbsp;AI tools and third-party transcription services must not be used during interviews or assessments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that the use of wearable technology, including any AI-related tools or other technology-connected devices (such as META or Google smart glasses and/or wearables, and/or any similar devices), is&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;strictly prohibited&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;during the interview and screening process with InterSystems.&amp;nbsp; Any applicant who requires a wearable device or any type of technology support during the interview process as a reasonable accommodation under the ADA or applicable state or country laws and regulations must contact the InterSystems Human Resources Department&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;prior&lt;/em&gt; to attending or participating in any interview or screening process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-section-id=&quot;a0mxx6&quot; data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;65&quot;&gt;Junior Sales Executive – Healthcare Solutions (Nord-Est Italia)&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;86&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;86&quot;&gt;Nord-Est Italia&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;11hlp9r&quot; data-start=&quot;88&quot; data-end=&quot;113&quot;&gt;Informazioni sul ruolo&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;115&quot; data-end=&quot;282&quot;&gt;Siamo alla ricerca di un &lt;strong data-start=&quot;140&quot; data-end=&quot;166&quot;&gt;Junior Sales Executive&lt;/strong&gt; motivato, che supporti la crescita del business &lt;strong data-start=&quot;215&quot; data-end=&quot;245&quot;&gt;Healthcare di InterSystems&lt;/strong&gt; nella regione del Nord-Est Italia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;284&quot; data-end=&quot;533&quot;&gt;Il candidato ideale ha un background nel settore &lt;strong data-start=&quot;333&quot; data-end=&quot;350&quot;&gt;Healthcare IT&lt;/strong&gt;, un forte interesse per l’&lt;strong data-start=&quot;377&quot; data-end=&quot;405&quot;&gt;Intelligenza Artificiale&lt;/strong&gt; e la &lt;strong data-start=&quot;411&quot; data-end=&quot;429&quot;&gt;digital health&lt;/strong&gt;, ed è desideroso di sviluppare una carriera nell’ambito delle vendite di soluzioni software enterprise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;535&quot; data-end=&quot;538&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;zkitoj&quot; data-start=&quot;540&quot; data-end=&quot;568&quot;&gt;Principali responsabilità&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;570&quot; data-end=&quot;1399&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1424ilg&quot; data-start=&quot;570&quot; data-end=&quot;683&quot;&gt;Sviluppare e gestire opportunità commerciali presso organizzazioni sanitarie nella regione del Nord-Est Italia.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;3mw1u2&quot; data-start=&quot;684&quot; data-end=&quot;812&quot;&gt;Costruire e mantenere relazioni solide con &lt;strong data-start=&quot;729&quot; data-end=&quot;811&quot;&gt;ospedali, autorità sanitarie regionali, system integrator e partner strategici&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;14yzaap&quot; data-start=&quot;813&quot; data-end=&quot;1009&quot;&gt;Identificare le esigenze dei clienti e proporre le soluzioni Healthcare di InterSystems, incluse piattaforme &lt;strong data-start=&quot;924&quot; data-end=&quot;1008&quot;&gt;EMR (Electronic Medical Record), interoperabilità e tecnologie abilitate dall’AI&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;pazth4&quot; data-start=&quot;1010&quot; data-end=&quot;1124&quot;&gt;Supportare la preparazione di proposte commerciali e partecipare ai processi di &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1092&quot; data-end=&quot;1123&quot;&gt;gara pubblica e procurement&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;mpuuln&quot; data-start=&quot;1125&quot; data-end=&quot;1272&quot;&gt;Collaborare a stretto contatto con i team &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1169&quot; data-end=&quot;1225&quot;&gt;Pre-Sales, Solution Architects, Marketing e Delivery&lt;/strong&gt; per sviluppare strategie commerciali vincenti.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;19kvha5&quot; data-start=&quot;1273&quot; data-end=&quot;1399&quot;&gt;Mantenere aggiornato e accurato il &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1310&quot; data-end=&quot;1328&quot;&gt;sales pipeline&lt;/strong&gt; e contribuire al raggiungimento degli obiettivi commerciali regionali.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1401&quot; data-end=&quot;1404&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1oxonug&quot; data-start=&quot;1406&quot; data-end=&quot;1418&quot;&gt;Requisiti&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1420&quot; data-end=&quot;2198&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;7wdwnn&quot; data-start=&quot;1420&quot; data-end=&quot;1545&quot;&gt;Laurea triennale o magistrale in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1455&quot; data-end=&quot;1525&quot;&gt;Informatica, Ingegneria, Informatica Sanitaria, Scienze della Vita&lt;/strong&gt; o ambiti correlati.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1vjfzkl&quot; data-start=&quot;1546&quot; data-end=&quot;1644&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1548&quot; data-end=&quot;1574&quot;&gt;2–5 anni di esperienza&lt;/strong&gt; nel settore &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1587&quot; data-end=&quot;1604&quot;&gt;Healthcare IT&lt;/strong&gt; o nella vendita di software enterprise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;wl1q2h&quot; data-start=&quot;1645&quot; data-end=&quot;1738&quot;&gt;Buona conoscenza del mercato sanitario italiano e dell’ecosistema della &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1719&quot; data-end=&quot;1737&quot;&gt;digital health&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;11t9txz&quot; data-start=&quot;1739&quot; data-end=&quot;1845&quot;&gt;Conoscenza dei concetti di &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1768&quot; data-end=&quot;1796&quot;&gt;Intelligenza Artificiale&lt;/strong&gt; e delle loro applicazioni nel settore sanitario.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;14qo0jf&quot; data-start=&quot;1846&quot; data-end=&quot;1945&quot;&gt;Familiarità con le normative italiane relative al &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1898&quot; data-end=&quot;1922&quot;&gt;procurement pubblico&lt;/strong&gt; e ai processi di gara.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1lkb1an&quot; data-start=&quot;1946&quot; data-end=&quot;2037&quot;&gt;Ottime capacità di comunicazione, presentazione e costruzione di relazioni professionali.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1gbg3vj&quot; data-start=&quot;2038&quot; data-end=&quot;2116&quot;&gt;Mentalità proattiva, orientata al cliente e al raggiungimento dei risultati.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;140mcvs&quot; data-start=&quot;2117&quot; data-end=&quot;2198&quot;&gt;Disponibilità a viaggiare frequentemente nella regione del &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2178&quot; data-end=&quot;2197&quot;&gt;Nord-Est Italia&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;2200&quot; data-end=&quot;2203&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;11pmf21&quot; data-start=&quot;2205&quot; data-end=&quot;2214&quot;&gt;Lingue&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2216&quot; data-end=&quot;2286&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1mp0ynu&quot; data-start=&quot;2216&quot; data-end=&quot;2235&quot;&gt;Italiano fluente.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;vyjrtb&quot; data-start=&quot;2236&quot; data-end=&quot;2286&quot;&gt;Buona conoscenza dell’inglese scritto e parlato.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;2288&quot; data-end=&quot;2291&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2293&quot; data-end=&quot;2590&quot;&gt;Questa posizione rappresenta un’ottima opportunità per entrare a far parte di un &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2374&quot; data-end=&quot;2419&quot;&gt;leader globale nella tecnologia sanitaria&lt;/strong&gt; e contribuire alla trasformazione digitale del sistema sanitario italiano attraverso soluzioni innovative basate su &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2536&quot; data-end=&quot;2589&quot;&gt;dati, interoperabilità e intelligenza artificiale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;2592&quot; data-end=&quot;2595&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2597&quot; data-end=&quot;2815&quot;&gt;InterSystems fornisce una stima in buona fede dell’intervallo di &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2662&quot; data-end=&quot;2692&quot;&gt;retribuzione base prevista&lt;/strong&gt; per questa posizione, che può variare in base a diversi fattori, tra cui esperienza, formazione, competenze e performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2817&quot; data-end=&quot;2936&quot;&gt;La retribuzione complessiva può includere anche un &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2868&quot; data-end=&quot;2913&quot;&gt;incentivo variabile annuale discrezionale&lt;/strong&gt; legato agli obiettivi.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;2938&quot; data-end=&quot;2941&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1oqhlhn&quot; data-start=&quot;2943&quot; data-end=&quot;2963&quot;&gt;Benefit aziendali&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2965&quot; data-end=&quot;3021&quot;&gt;L’azienda offre inoltre un pacchetto di benefit tra cui:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3023&quot; data-end=&quot;3062&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1h4ou14&quot; data-start=&quot;3023&quot; data-end=&quot;3048&quot;&gt;Assicurazione sanitaria&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;19ajoq6&quot; data-start=&quot;3049&quot; data-end=&quot;3062&quot;&gt;Buoni pasto&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3064&quot; data-end=&quot;3118&quot;&gt;La fascia retributiva base stimata per questo ruolo è:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3120&quot; data-end=&quot;3145&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3120&quot; data-end=&quot;3145&quot;&gt;€50.000 – €60.000 EUR&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;3147&quot; data-end=&quot;3150&quot;&gt;
&lt;h1 data-section-id=&quot;1gertbt&quot; data-start=&quot;3152&quot; data-end=&quot;3182&quot;&gt;Informazioni su InterSystems&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3184&quot; data-end=&quot;3459&quot;&gt;InterSystems, azienda innovativa nel settore delle tecnologie dei dati, fornisce una piattaforma unificata per lo sviluppo di applicazioni di nuova generazione destinata ai clienti dei settori &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3377&quot; data-end=&quot;3440&quot;&gt;sanitario, finanziario, manifatturiero e della supply chain&lt;/strong&gt; in oltre 80 Paesi.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3461&quot; data-end=&quot;3691&quot;&gt;Le nostre piattaforme dati risolvono problemi di &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3510&quot; data-end=&quot;3554&quot;&gt;interoperabilità, velocità e scalabilità&lt;/strong&gt; per grandi organizzazioni in tutto il mondo, consentendo loro di valorizzare il potenziale dei dati e di utilizzarli in modi innovativi.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3693&quot; data-end=&quot;3875&quot;&gt;Fondata nel 1978, InterSystems si impegna a garantire l’eccellenza attraverso un servizio di supporto clienti e partner disponibile &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3825&quot; data-end=&quot;3856&quot;&gt;24 ore su 24, 7 giorni su 7&lt;/strong&gt; in tutto il mondo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3877&quot; data-end=&quot;3985&quot;&gt;Azienda privata con sede centrale a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3913&quot; data-end=&quot;3938&quot;&gt;Boston, Massachusetts&lt;/strong&gt;, InterSystems conta &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3959&quot; data-end=&quot;3984&quot;&gt;38 uffici in 28 Paesi&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3987&quot; data-end=&quot;4041&quot;&gt;Per maggiori informazioni visita &lt;strong data-start=&quot;4020&quot; data-end=&quot;4040&quot;&gt;InterSystems.com&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;4043&quot; data-end=&quot;4046&quot;&gt;
&lt;h1 data-section-id=&quot;106pivz&quot; data-start=&quot;4048&quot; data-end=&quot;4076&quot;&gt;Nota sull’utilizzo dell’AI&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4078&quot; data-end=&quot;4415&quot;&gt;InterSystems può utilizzare strumenti di &lt;strong data-start=&quot;4119&quot; data-end=&quot;4147&quot;&gt;Intelligenza Artificiale&lt;/strong&gt; per attività operative interne, incluse alcune attività amministrative durante il processo di selezione (ad esempio l’organizzazione delle informazioni sui candidati). L’approccio di InterSystems all’AI segue le &lt;strong data-start=&quot;4360&quot; data-end=&quot;4414&quot;&gt;Linee guida per un’AI responsabile di InterSystems&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4417&quot; data-end=&quot;4569&quot;&gt;L’AI &lt;strong data-start=&quot;4422&quot; data-end=&quot;4503&quot;&gt;non viene utilizzata per prendere decisioni di assunzione né per influenzarle&lt;/strong&gt;. Tutte le decisioni vengono prese dai dipendenti di InterSystems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4571&quot; data-end=&quot;4741&quot;&gt;I candidati possono utilizzare strumenti di AI per la preparazione del CV o dei colloqui, purché i materiali siano veritieri e riflettano la propria esperienza personale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4743&quot; data-end=&quot;4869&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot; data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Gli strumenti di AI e i servizi di trascrizione di terze parti &lt;strong data-start=&quot;4806&quot; data-end=&quot;4868&quot;&gt;non devono essere utilizzati durante colloqui o assessment&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About InterSystems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;InterSystems, a creative data technology provider, delivers a unified foundation for next-generation applications for healthcare, finance, manufacturing, and supply chain customers in more than 80 countries. Our data platforms solve interoperability, speed, and scalability problems for large organizations around the globe to unlock the power of data and allow people to perceive data in imaginative ways. Established in 1978, InterSystems is committed to excellence through its 24×7 support for customers and partners around the world. Privately held and headquartered in Boston, Massachusetts, InterSystems has 38 offices in 28 countries worldwide. For more information, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https://www.intersystems.com/&amp;amp;esheet=53379223&amp;amp;newsitemid=20230410005415&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=InterSystems.com&amp;amp;index=4&amp;amp;md5=3edf749fa33f5a2ac0c355c410576e90&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;1e721f69-f681-4067-9281-970e94b3ef11&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InterSystems.com&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Disclaimer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InterSystems may use AI tools for its internal operations including administrative tasks during recruitment (e.g., organizing candidate information). &amp;nbsp;InterSystems’ approach to AI is guided by the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.intersystems.com/ai-use-guidelines/&quot;&gt;InterSystems Responsible AI Guidelines&lt;/a&gt;. AI is not used to make or influence hiring decisions. All decisions are made by InterSystems employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates may use AI for CV or interview preparation, provided materials are truthful and reflect their own experience. &amp;nbsp;AI tools and third-party transcription services must not be used during interviews or assessments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that the use of wearable technology, including any AI-related tools or other technology-connected devices (such as META or Google smart glasses and/or wearables, and/or any similar devices), is&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;strictly prohibited&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;during the interview and screening process with InterSystems.&amp;nbsp; Any applicant who requires a wearable device or any type of technology support during the interview process as a reasonable accommodation under the ADA or applicable state or country laws and regulations must contact the InterSystems Human Resources Department&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;prior&lt;/em&gt; to attending or participating in any interview or screening process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Junior Sales Executive – Healthcare Solutions (North-East Italy)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a motivated &lt;strong&gt;Junior Sales Executive&lt;/strong&gt; to support the growth of InterSystems&#39; Healthcare business across the &lt;strong&gt;North-East Italy&lt;/strong&gt; region. The ideal candidate has a background in &lt;strong&gt;Healthcare IT&lt;/strong&gt;, a strong interest in &lt;strong&gt;Artificial Intelligence&lt;/strong&gt; and digital health, and is eager to develop a career in enterprise software sales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and manage sales opportunities within healthcare organizations across North-East Italy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain relationships with hospitals, regional healthcare authorities, system integrators, and strategic partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify customer needs and position InterSystems&#39; healthcare solutions, including EMR, interoperability, and AI-enabled technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
