&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, Healthcare Informatics, Life Sciences, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2–5 years of experience in Healthcare IT or enterprise software sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of the Italian healthcare market and digital health ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;Artificial Intelligence&lt;/strong&gt; concepts and their application in healthcare.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with &lt;strong&gt;Italian public procurement regulations&lt;/strong&gt; and public tendering processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication, presentation, and relationship-building skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive, customer-oriented, and results-driven mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel extensively across the North-East Italy region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
