&lt;p&gt;Platform Engineering is seeking an experienced engineering manager to lead a team responsible for building and evolving the internal platforms that power software development across the company. This role leads engineers delivering modern build systems, developer tooling, cloud-native infrastructure, automation, and AI-enabled engineering capabilities that improve developer productivity, platform reliability, and software delivery while partnering across the organization to accelerate engineering excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Technical &amp;amp; Platform Leadership&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the evolution of the company&#39;s Platform Engineering capabilities to enable faster, more secure, and more reliable software delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive modernization of build systems, developer tooling, CI/CD, release automation, and Software Factory capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion cloud-native architectures, automation, Infrastructure as Code, and engineering best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate and adopt AI-driven capabilities that improve developer productivity, software delivery, and engineering workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical leadership and architectural guidance while empowering engineers to own implementation details.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;People Leadership&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, mentor, and grow a high-performing team of Platform Engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruit, coach, and develop engineering talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a collaborative, innovative, and accountable engineering culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Delivery &amp;amp; Execution&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own delivery of strategic Platform Engineering initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance platform investments, operational priorities, and technical debt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify risks, remove blockers, and communicate tradeoffs effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and measure platform success through adoption, reliability, developer productivity, automation, and software delivery outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Collaboration&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong partnerships across Development, Quality Development, Security, Technical Services, Managed Services, and Product teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate business objectives into engineering priorities and execution plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Platform Engineering in cross-functional planning and executive discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion Platform Engineering as a strategic partner that enables engineering productivity across the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of experience in software engineering, platform engineering, infrastructure engineering, or DevOps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of engineering management experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with several of the following: cloud-native platforms, Kubernetes, CI/CD, build systems, developer tooling, automation, and Infrastructure as Code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading cross-functional technical initiatives from planning through delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, collaboration, and stakeholder management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building Internal Developer Platforms (IDPs) or developer platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading modernization of build systems, software factories, or enterprise engineering platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with DevSecOps practices and software supply chain security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with AI-powered engineering tools and agentic coding assistants (e.g., Claude Code, GitHub Copilot, Tabnine).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to evaluate and adopt emerging AI technologies that improve software delivery, platform operations, and developer productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
