&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead the ANZ events program, including conferences, trade shows, executive forums, customer roundtables and partner events.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
