&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong understanding of digital marketing, demand generation and marketing automation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to communicate technical concepts clearly and develop customer-focused messaging.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent stakeholder management and collaboration skills, with the ability to work across teams and functions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong project management and organisational skills, with attention to detail and the ability to manage competing priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;An analytical approach to measuring performance, solving problems and identifying improvements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A proactive, adaptable attitude and the ability to remain effective when priorities change.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
