&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years&#39; experience in B2B marketing, ideally within enterprise software or technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience leading and developing marketing teams is essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience developing and executing integrated regional marketing campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with demand generation, digital marketing and marketing automation (HubSpot desirable).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management skills with the ability to influence across Sales, Product Management and regional leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and project management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate complex technical concepts into compelling customer value propositions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel throughout Southeast Asia.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
