&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;This position may be eligible for sales incentives based on certain sales goals, achievements, and results. While sales incentives, if any, vary they generally will result in payment of 35% to 45% of base pay, assuming on-target achievement.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
