&lt;li&gt;5–10 years of experience in partner programs, partner operations, channel management, or a related business operations role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Pega, PRM, SharePoint, Microsoft Office, and reporting tools; experience with workflow automation platforms is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized with exceptional attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Logical and analytical thinker with strong problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive, self-motivated, and able to work independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project and program management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable leading change and driving process improvements from concept through implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner-focused.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptable and flexible, with the ability to manage competing priorities and take on evolving responsibilities as business needs change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative with excellent relationship-building, stakeholder management, and influencing skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process-oriented with a continuous improvement mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-driven, with strong analytical, reporting, and decision-making skills.&lt;/li&gt;
