&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you ready to take the next step in your professional career?&lt;/strong&gt; We invite you to be part of &lt;strong&gt;InterSystems’ 2025 Professional Internship Program&lt;/strong&gt;. Here, you will have the opportunity to immerse yourself in the exciting world of technology and contribute to projects that directly impact a variety of industries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our internships are &lt;strong&gt;paid&lt;/strong&gt; and offer an enriching environment where you will not only learn, but also become a key member of our teams. You will collaborate with highly skilled professionals while tackling real-world challenges, allowing you to strengthen both your technical and non-technical skills—essential for a successful career after graduation. In addition, you will build valuable connections with fellow interns and InterSystems employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are curious, proactive, and passionate about technology, &lt;strong&gt;this opportunity is for you&lt;/strong&gt;!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Program Overview&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Start Date:&lt;/strong&gt; Flexible, based on the student&#39;s availability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Duration:&lt;/strong&gt; We offer internships ranging from &lt;strong&gt;2 months to 1 year&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Training:&lt;/strong&gt; Gain in-depth knowledge of InterSystems products and business areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentorship:&lt;/strong&gt; Receive guidance and support from our experienced professionals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Networking:&lt;/strong&gt; Connect with InterSystems employees across different departments, expanding your future career opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Career Opportunities:&lt;/strong&gt; Interns will have a competitive advantage for future invitations to extend their internships or join InterSystems full-time after graduation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Program Requirements&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Availability to participate in a &lt;strong&gt;full-time internship&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work &lt;strong&gt;on-site&lt;/strong&gt; at our office located in &lt;strong&gt;Ciudad Empresarial, Huechuraba, Santiago, Chile&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participation in essential training sessions required to successfully complete individual projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently enrolled in a bachelor&#39;s degree program at a university or institute.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possess valid student insurance for the entire duration of the internship.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be in the final year of a degree program in &lt;strong&gt;Computer Science, Software Engineering, or a related field&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the fundamental concepts of &lt;strong&gt;Artificial Intelligence (AI), Machine Learning (ML), and Generative AI&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the capabilities, limitations, and risks associated with AI models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use tools such as &lt;strong&gt;ChatGPT, Copilot, or similar AI solutions&lt;/strong&gt; to support development, documentation, and analytical tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply basic prompt engineering techniques to achieve effective and relevant results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Critically evaluate AI-generated outputs, validating their accuracy, consistency, and reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand principles of privacy, security, bias mitigation, and ethical AI usage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interpret and analyze data to support automation processes and decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate AI tools into productivity workflows and software development processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Properly document the use of AI and distinguish between AI-generated content and user-validated content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Natural curiosity and a strong desire to learn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creativity in solving challenges and problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team-oriented mindset and effective collaboration skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility and adaptability in a dynamic work environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initiative to build a meaningful career that creates impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;English language proficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you would like to be part of a company that delivers essential technology solutions and helps build a strong professional future, we look forward to receiving your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us and make a difference!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
