&lt;p&gt;InterSystems is a global technology provider focused on high-performance data platforms that power mission-critical applications across healthcare, financial services, and the public sector. As the company continues its transition from primarily on-premises deployments to cloud-based and SaaS-delivered solutions, the Managed Services organization plays a central role in operating, securing, and scaling these environments for customers worldwide.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Managed Services is responsible for the reliability, security, and compliance of InterSystems-hosted platforms across public cloud, private cloud, and datacenter environments. This includes enabling a consistent, secure operating model that meets stringent regulatory and customer requirements while supporting rapid innovation and service delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Role Summary&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Security Automation Engineer develops and implements automation frameworks to improve security operations, compliance, and consistency across Managed Services platforms, enabling scalable and repeatable security controls.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement security automation using tools such as Terraform and scripting languages (Python, Bash)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate security controls into CI/CD pipelines and infrastructure provisioning workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automate deployment and configuration of security tools including HashiCorp Vault and cloud-native services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop automated remediation workflows for security incidents and compliance findings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with engineering teams to embed security into platform architectures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive standardization of security automation patterns across environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support vulnerability management and compliance automation initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Required Qualifications and Experience&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in security engineering, DevSecOps, or automation roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with Terraform and infrastructure-as-code practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with HashiCorp Vault or similar secrets management tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with scripting languages (Python, Bash, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of cloud platforms (AWS, Azure) and DevOps pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with security tooling and integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving and automation mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant certifications encouraged (e.g., HashiCorp, AWS, Azure Security)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About InterSystems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
