&lt;h2&gt;Senior Manager, Service Reliability &amp;amp; Customer Operations&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;InterSystems is seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Manager, Service Reliability &amp;amp; Customer Operations&lt;/strong&gt; to lead the global teams responsible for operating, securing, and continuously improving our Managed Services platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;This role combines &lt;strong&gt;technical leadership, operational management, customer engagement, and people leadership&lt;/strong&gt;, with accountability for service reliability, security and compliance, operational excellence, and customer experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead globally distributed teams across &lt;strong&gt;Operations &amp;amp; Reliability, Security &amp;amp; Compliance, and Customer Experience&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive improvements in service availability, observability, capacity management, backup and recovery, disaster recovery, and operational tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure operational readiness for new platform capabilities and services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee identity, access controls, vulnerability management, compliance automation, audit readiness, and security operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve customer-facing operations, including reporting, notifications, lifecycle workflows, provisioning visibility, and dashboards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead major incidents and customer-impacting events, including Severity 1 incidents and emergency production actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Managed Services during customer escalations, audits, assurance activities, and executive engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance reliability, customer outcomes, operational risk, and cost efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach, hire, and develop a high-performing global organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;10+ years&lt;/strong&gt; of experience in cloud operations, managed services, service delivery, SRE, security operations, or related disciplines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3+ years of people leadership experience&lt;/strong&gt; managing technical teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading globally distributed operational organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of cloud infrastructure, managed services operations, reliability, observability, security, and compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience leading major incidents and managing customer-facing escalations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in regulated or compliance-driven environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong leadership, communication, and stakeholder management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to balance customer needs, technical priorities, operational risk, and business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing teams across multiple technical disciplines is strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, Information Systems, or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
