&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Join InterSystems and help us shape the future of digital healthcare. The sheer scale of our capabilities and client engagements and the way we collaborate, operate and deliver value provides an unparalleled opportunity to grow and advance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Choose InterSystems and make delivering innovative work part of your extraordinary career.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;InterSystems is the place for someone looking for the next exciting and challenging step in their career and access to the kind of training, expertise and development tools that only a large company can offer. Our international reach also means you could be part of a truly global organization of smart, technically inclined people.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are seeking Quality Specialists to enhance the quality, performance and usability of innovative products that transform healthcare organizations. Apply your healthcare or clinical expertise with cutting-edge tools and technologies to improve patient outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will be embedded within a cross-functional Agile development team focused on product quality. Agile teams consist of developers and product specialists collectively responsible for all stages of product development from design to validation of specific areas of the EMR.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About the Product:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Healthcare organizations in 29 countries use TrakCare and IntelliCare to support coordinated care across hospitals and care settings.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Built on the InterSystems HealthShare health informatics platform, these solutions provide a comprehensive patient record, secure access to information across care settings, interoperability with other systems, and real-time analytics to help clinicians improve patient outcomes, increase efficiency, and reduce costs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Duties &amp;amp; Responsibilities:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
